COMMENT ON COLUMN "PrincipalSpec"."consentState" IS 'NOT_APPLICABLE for OWNER and MEMBER, who consented by joining the Realm. For a CONTACT, the Realm''s own record of whether that person agreed to being modeled -- never proof of consent, only a claim the Realm makes.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "PrincipalSpec"."personalSpaceRef_uid" IS 'Present only for OWNER and MEMBER. A CONTACT has no login or workspace here.';

