COMMENT ON COLUMN "AppraisalDimensions".provenance_id IS 'Signature, digest, SBOM, licence and publisher.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "AppraisalDimensions".security_id IS 'Blast radius per operation, network egress, secret material held, and untrusted output.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "AppraisalDimensions".relevance_id IS 'Whether each exposed operation maps to a capability this Realm already declares.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "AppraisalDimensions"."agentUsability_id" IS 'Whether an agent can use it without guessing.';

