COMMENT ON COLUMN "McpBundleOperation"."recoveryPlanDigest" IS 'Required in Rego when effect is SYSTEM_EFFECT and the bundle is ENABLED (ADR-0056 decision 3).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "McpBundleOperation"."killSwitchRef" IS 'Required in Rego when effect is SYSTEM_EFFECT and the bundle is ENABLED (ADR-0056 decision 4).';
